        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Yarrick<strong> consumes all remaining actions</strong> in this round (including this action) and <strong>removes </strong>sections from his Break Clock<strong> equals to consumed actions.</strong> Thereafter, he enters <strong>Launching Stance.</strong></p>\n<p>While Yarrick is in this stance, his <strong>Defense and Magic Defense is reduced </strong>by<strong> 4</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>and&nbsp;<strong>receives half damage</strong> from all source and all attacks that hit will increase <strong>Break Clock</strong> section by <strong>1</strong>.</p>\n<p>At the end of the round, unless Yarrick is <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/faze.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.MziQo5K1cu829GIU]{Break}</strong>, he will performs <strong>SkyScream Strike.</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "Launching Stance",
          "roll": ""
        },
