        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>All of Yarrick's attack receives <strong>extra accuracy check&nbsp;</strong>equals to <strong>【Enemy inflicted with <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/RPR/cross_reaping.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.GePNxftPupElcCWp]{Bleed}】</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Prey Tracing"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>After an enemy miss an attack on Yarrick, he may perform a <strong>free attack&nbsp;</strong>with&nbsp;<strong>Retaliate Stab.</strong></p>\n<p>This can only be activated <strong>once per round</strong>.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Swift Revenge"
        }
      },
