      "tactic_notes": "<h1>Yarrick the Defiled Boss Behavior Table</h1>\n<p><strong>Combo List</strong></p>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; height: 377px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 15.9006%;\"><col style=\"width: 18.2653%;\"><col style=\"width: 38.3806%;\"><col style=\"width: 27.4534%;\"></colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\"><strong>Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\"><strong>Actions</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\"><strong>Description/Notes</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Recommendation</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 72px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 72px;\">Bleed Mechanic</td>\n<td style=\"height: 72px;\">\n<ol>\n<li>Ebon Spear</li>\n<li>(P) Prey Tracing</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 72px;\">\n<p>Improve boss accuracy by applying bleed to target.</p>\n<p>Good to start a round with, very deadly when applied to everyone.</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">ST Nuke</td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<ol>\n<li>Surging Stomp</li>\n<li>Relentless Thrust</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<p>Setup target using Surging Stomp and nullify target Guard Action, then follow with high damage Relentless Thrust (Chain(3) attacks)</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">Force Decision ST Nuke</td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<ol>\n<li>Deceptive Strike</li>\n<li>Swift Exploit</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<p>Start with simple light hit that; when missed, follow with very strong ST damage. Player has to take slow debuff or risk getting hit hard.</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">Evasive Counter</td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<ol>\n<li>(P) Swift Revenge</li>\n<li>Retaliate Stab</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<p>Counter attack that apply <strong>Paralyzed</strong>. Use against player with many skill usage after attack.</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>When Tank or Skill-based player misses an attack.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">Anti-Air &amp; Anti-Tank</td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<ol>\n<li>Harpoon Toss</li>\n<li>Reeling In (Free)</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<p>Range move against flying or tank unit, with free follow-up that <strong>Grapple </strong>target.</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>When there is a Flying player</p>\n<p>When Tank player is Guard-Cover</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">Delay Ambush Setup</td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<ol>\n<li>Whirlwind Waltz</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<p>Setup an end-round flurry attacks by using Whirlwind Waltz spell to gain extra action for attacks.</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Use once around Round 3.</p>\n<p>Use again when HP &lt; 40%</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\"><strong>Boss Main Mechanic</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<ol>\n<li>Launching Stance</li>\n<li>SkyScream Strike</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<p>Boss main mechanic involving Break system. Use at the start of any round to force player to apply Break to boss, or receive massive damage.</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>When Break clock is mostly unfilled.</p>\n<p>Use once at the start of the fight.</p>\n<p>Use again at HP &lt; 50% and the clock is mostly unfilled.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
